      "explanation": "The escape velocity of a planet is given by the formula:\n\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.281ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17.201ex\" height=\"4.208ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1293.8 7602.6 1860\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"76\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-76\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(561,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">escape</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3434.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\" transform=\"translate(4490.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,83.8)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(1020,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1286,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(777.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><rect width=\"1852.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><rect width=\"2092.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"1020\" y=\"1173.8\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n\n<br><br>where G is the gravitational constant, M is the mass of the planet, and R is its radius.\n\n<br><br>If the escape velocity of planet A is v<sub>A</sub> and the escape velocity of planet B is v<sub>B</sub>, then we can write the following relationship:\n\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -3.573ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23.674ex\" height=\"7.318ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1655.2 10464.1 3234.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(518,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(222.2,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(518,-152.7) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g></g></g></g><rect width=\"981.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1498.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2554.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAt